1
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:08,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,290 --> 00:00:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,520 --> 00:00:18,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,710 --> 00:00:25,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,360 --> 00:00:30,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:36,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,130 --> 00:00:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:47,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,720 --> 00:00:52,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:58,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,820 --> 00:01:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,080 --> 00:01:04,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:12,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,020 --> 00:01:16,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 4]</font>

15
00:01:17,620 --> 00:01:18,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">During this case,</font>

16
00:01:19,420 --> 00:01:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was with Jun Qinglan day and night.</font>

17
00:01:20,860 --> 00:01:21,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Feelings developed between us.</font>

18
00:01:26,580 --> 00:01:27,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Your Majesty.
- Silence!</font>

19
00:01:27,860 --> 00:01:28,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please allow me to explain.</font>

20
00:01:29,220 --> 00:01:30,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

21
00:01:31,780 --> 00:01:33,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You deliberately used this
to humiliate me.</font>

22
00:01:34,100 --> 00:01:35,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am already a disgraced official.</font>

23
00:01:37,140 --> 00:01:38,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have acted perversely</font>

24
00:01:38,940 --> 00:01:40,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and done many absurd
and improper things.</font>

25
00:01:42,340 --> 00:01:43,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a dying man.</font>

26
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:44,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only beg you</font>

27
00:01:45,860 --> 00:01:47,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to grant me this final wish.</font>

28
00:01:56,340 --> 00:01:57,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She is merely a coroner.</font>

29
00:01:58,780 --> 00:01:59,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She is the one reaching
above her station.</font>

30
00:02:02,340 --> 00:02:02,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan,</font>

31
00:02:03,820 --> 00:02:04,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you have any objection?</font>

32
00:02:04,980 --> 00:02:05,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, I do.</font>

33
00:02:08,780 --> 00:02:09,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, I don't.</font>

34
00:02:10,340 --> 00:02:11,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In consideration of your merit
in solving the case,</font>

35
00:02:12,220 --> 00:02:13,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I shall grant you
a thousand liang of gold</font>

36
00:02:13,820 --> 00:02:14,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as your dowry.</font>

37
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:16,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do not make this matter widely known.</font>

38
00:02:18,180 --> 00:02:18,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan,</font>

39
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:20,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">join me in thanking His Majesty.</font>

40
00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:26,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.</font>

41
00:02:26,220 --> 00:02:27,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Withdraw, both of you!</font>

42
00:02:34,020 --> 00:02:34,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty.</font>

43
00:02:35,780 --> 00:02:37,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan is a noble.</font>

44
00:02:38,020 --> 00:02:39,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Xizhao Princess</font>

45
00:02:39,380 --> 00:02:40,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has just been laid to rest.</font>

46
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:44,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For Prince Duan to seek
a lowly coroner's hand now,</font>

47
00:02:45,180 --> 00:02:45,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it is simply</font>

48
00:02:46,060 --> 00:02:46,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">preposterous.</font>

49
00:02:46,860 --> 00:02:48,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Utterly preposterous.</font>

50
00:02:48,940 --> 00:02:50,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo is away from the capital.</font>

51
00:02:51,900 --> 00:02:54,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have many matters
that require his help.</font>

52
00:02:56,140 --> 00:02:57,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She is merely a female coroner.</font>

53
00:02:58,380 --> 00:02:59,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he wants her, let him have her.</font>

54
00:03:01,700 --> 00:03:02,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A marriage decree?</font>

55
00:03:03,980 --> 00:03:04,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

56
00:03:05,380 --> 00:03:06,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you trying to announce this
to the whole world?</font>

57
00:03:07,940 --> 00:03:09,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could His Majesty
ever agree to this?</font>

58
00:03:09,380 --> 00:03:10,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't this sheer madness?</font>

59
00:03:10,700 --> 00:03:11,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In His Majesty's eyes,</font>

60
00:03:12,060 --> 00:03:13,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am just a lowly coroner.</font>

61
00:03:14,260 --> 00:03:16,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And he is Prince Duan.</font>

62
00:03:16,180 --> 00:03:17,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He even threatened with his life.</font>

63
00:03:17,540 --> 00:03:18,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I suspect His Majesty</font>

64
00:03:18,340 --> 00:03:19,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just couldn't refuse him outright.</font>

65
00:03:20,940 --> 00:03:22,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since His Majesty has decreed it,</font>

66
00:03:23,140 --> 00:03:23,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to refuse</font>

67
00:03:23,980 --> 00:03:24,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is to defy the imperial edict.</font>

68
00:03:26,020 --> 00:03:26,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan,</font>

69
00:03:26,860 --> 00:03:27,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how about I</font>

70
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:28,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take you and Mrs. Jun</font>

71
00:03:29,220 --> 00:03:30,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and flee Beiyuan?</font>

72
00:03:30,980 --> 00:03:31,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

73
00:03:32,140 --> 00:03:33,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are the heir of Duke Dingguo,</font>

74
00:03:34,260 --> 00:03:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Deputy Minister,</font>

75
00:03:35,580 --> 00:03:36,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a pillar of the state.</font>

76
00:03:36,820 --> 00:03:38,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How could I ruin your future?</font>

77
00:03:38,660 --> 00:03:39,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then,</font>

78
00:03:39,700 --> 00:03:41,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tell him your heart belongs to another.</font>

79
00:03:41,300 --> 00:03:42,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, absolutely not.</font>

80
00:03:43,500 --> 00:03:44,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">None of that works?</font>

81
00:03:44,580 --> 00:03:45,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should I just watch helplessly</font>

82
00:03:45,580 --> 00:03:47,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as he drags you into his mansion
and abuses you?</font>

83
00:03:49,500 --> 00:03:50,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The only person who can help me now</font>

84
00:03:51,380 --> 00:03:52,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is Princess Changle.</font>

85
00:03:53,580 --> 00:03:54,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have to take this gamble.</font>

86
00:03:55,180 --> 00:03:56,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that things have come to this,</font>

87
00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:57,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">tell me the truth.</font>

88
00:03:58,020 --> 00:03:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why have you gone to such lengths</font>

89
00:04:00,660 --> 00:04:01,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to get close to Changle?</font>

90
00:04:06,060 --> 00:04:07,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My brother is
at Princess Changle's Mansion.</font>

91
00:04:09,980 --> 00:04:11,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

92
00:04:14,180 --> 00:04:15,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is the matter?</font>

93
00:04:15,540 --> 00:04:15,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Speak.</font>

94
00:04:17,780 --> 00:04:18,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

95
00:04:18,740 --> 00:04:19,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan</font>

96
00:04:19,500 --> 00:04:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has brought many men and raided</font>

97
00:04:21,140 --> 00:04:23,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the gambling dens
on Guisha Street again.</font>

98
00:04:24,020 --> 00:04:25,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Anyone who resisted</font>

99
00:04:25,860 --> 00:04:27,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was executed on the spot.</font>

100
00:04:29,020 --> 00:04:30,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought a Xizhao Princess</font>

101
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:32,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would trouble him for a while.</font>

102
00:04:33,380 --> 00:04:35,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't expect him
to handle it with such ease.</font>

103
00:04:36,420 --> 00:04:37,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's clinging to his last breath,</font>

104
00:04:37,900 --> 00:04:39,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">getting in my way.</font>

105
00:04:39,980 --> 00:04:42,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan is taking advantage
of his impending death.</font>

106
00:04:42,380 --> 00:04:44,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one dares to block his path.</font>

107
00:04:44,900 --> 00:04:45,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan</font>

108
00:04:46,060 --> 00:04:47,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not only cunning</font>

109
00:04:47,300 --> 00:04:48,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but also ruthless to the core.</font>

110
00:04:48,940 --> 00:04:51,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's a monkey raised on Qin peppers.</font>

111
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:53,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If he continues like this,</font>

112
00:04:54,740 --> 00:04:56,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my private banks, gambling dens,
and salt ships</font>

113
00:04:56,940 --> 00:04:58,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">will all be confiscated by him.</font>

114
00:05:00,060 --> 00:05:01,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the young emperor's hands,</font>

115
00:05:01,780 --> 00:05:04,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he is truly a sharp blade.</font>

116
00:05:05,420 --> 00:05:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No matter how sharp,</font>

117
00:05:06,940 --> 00:05:08,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it is still just a tool.</font>

118
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:09,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Besides,</font>

119
00:05:09,580 --> 00:05:10,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's old and neglected.</font>

120
00:05:11,460 --> 00:05:13,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bai, do you have a plan?</font>

121
00:05:35,700 --> 00:05:38,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I always thought you cared only
for art and poetry.</font>

122
00:05:39,140 --> 00:05:40,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never imagined</font>

123
00:05:40,100 --> 00:05:42,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'd also have a talent for strategy.</font>

124
00:05:45,140 --> 00:05:45,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

125
00:05:46,180 --> 00:05:47,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Judicial Review coroner
is here again,</font>

126
00:05:48,060 --> 00:05:49,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">waiting outside to see you.</font>

127
00:05:50,220 --> 00:05:51,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't even gone after her yet,</font>

128
00:05:51,380 --> 00:05:53,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and she dares to come to me?</font>

129
00:05:54,780 --> 00:05:55,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Show her in.</font>

130
00:05:56,500 --> 00:05:56,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

131
00:06:02,140 --> 00:06:04,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Princess Changle's Mansion]</font>

132
00:06:04,060 --> 00:06:05,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm Jun Qinglan.</font>

133
00:06:05,500 --> 00:06:06,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, Your Highness.</font>

134
00:06:07,860 --> 00:06:08,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is this?</font>

135
00:06:09,100 --> 00:06:11,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun, was humiliating me
in the public court</font>

136
00:06:11,980 --> 00:06:13,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">not enough for you?</font>

137
00:06:13,820 --> 00:06:15,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you come all this way
just to insult me further?</font>

138
00:06:16,100 --> 00:06:16,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wouldn't dare.</font>

139
00:06:17,900 --> 00:06:19,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I truly have no powerful connections,</font>

140
00:06:19,660 --> 00:06:21,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no way to stand against Prince Duan.</font>

141
00:06:21,940 --> 00:06:23,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He forced that poison</font>

142
00:06:23,380 --> 00:06:24,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">down my throat</font>

143
00:06:24,620 --> 00:06:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">right in front of Eunuch Fuhai.</font>

144
00:06:26,220 --> 00:06:27,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I had no choice.</font>

145
00:06:27,820 --> 00:06:29,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one could've helped me.</font>

146
00:06:30,460 --> 00:06:32,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My life may be worthless,</font>

147
00:06:32,740 --> 00:06:33,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but if I had died,</font>

148
00:06:33,420 --> 00:06:35,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wouldn't I have failed</font>

149
00:06:35,060 --> 00:06:36,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your painstaking efforts for me?</font>

150
00:06:37,660 --> 00:06:38,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I held onto this life,</font>

151
00:06:39,340 --> 00:06:40,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so that in the days to come,</font>

152
00:06:40,340 --> 00:06:42,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can repay your great kindness.</font>

153
00:06:44,180 --> 00:06:44,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fuhai.</font>

154
00:06:45,620 --> 00:06:46,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

155
00:06:47,780 --> 00:06:49,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Did you witness the poisoning</font>

156
00:06:49,460 --> 00:06:50,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she spoke of with your own eyes?</font>

157
00:06:52,180 --> 00:06:54,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan kissed her.</font>

158
00:06:54,380 --> 00:06:55,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought...</font>

159
00:06:56,420 --> 00:06:57,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You useless fool!</font>

160
00:06:57,620 --> 00:06:59,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I deserve death!</font>

161
00:06:59,500 --> 00:07:01,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please don't blame Eunuch Fuhai.</font>

162
00:07:01,980 --> 00:07:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was my own lack of vigilance</font>

163
00:07:03,900 --> 00:07:05,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that gave Prince Duan his chance.</font>

164
00:07:07,420 --> 00:07:09,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You came to see me today</font>

165
00:07:10,220 --> 00:07:11,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to beg for forgiveness?</font>

166
00:07:12,660 --> 00:07:13,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That is the first reason.</font>

167
00:07:14,180 --> 00:07:15,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And the most important one.</font>

168
00:07:17,420 --> 00:07:18,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is the second?</font>

169
00:07:20,540 --> 00:07:21,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I beg you to save me.</font>

170
00:07:22,700 --> 00:07:24,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan has asked His Majesty</font>

171
00:07:24,740 --> 00:07:26,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to betroth me to him.</font>

172
00:07:26,900 --> 00:07:27,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A marriage decree?</font>

173
00:07:28,460 --> 00:07:29,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, Your Highness, save me.</font>

174
00:07:30,060 --> 00:07:30,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have yet to repay</font>

175
00:07:30,780 --> 00:07:32,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your kindness in promoting me.</font>

176
00:07:33,300 --> 00:07:35,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If this is His Majesty's will,</font>

177
00:07:35,620 --> 00:07:37,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I fear I cannot interfere.</font>

178
00:07:39,260 --> 00:07:40,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Everyone has their own fate.</font>

179
00:07:41,020 --> 00:07:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should leave now.</font>

180
00:07:43,540 --> 00:07:45,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, Your Highness, please!</font>

181
00:07:45,700 --> 00:07:48,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao is a monster
who'd bleed you dry.</font>

182
00:07:48,340 --> 00:07:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even nine lives wouldn't be enough
for him to ruin.</font>

183
00:07:51,140 --> 00:07:52,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't yet served you.</font>

184
00:07:53,060 --> 00:07:54,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you save me,</font>

185
00:07:54,460 --> 00:07:56,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll gladly work
like a beast of burden for you.</font>

186
00:07:58,020 --> 00:08:02,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Princess Changle's Mansion]</font>

187
00:08:02,780 --> 00:08:03,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

188
00:08:05,100 --> 00:08:05,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

189
00:08:05,740 --> 00:08:06,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you cannot enter like this.</font>

190
00:08:06,860 --> 00:08:07,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

191
00:08:08,740 --> 00:08:09,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

192
00:08:09,460 --> 00:08:10,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you cannot enter like this.</font>

193
00:08:10,740 --> 00:08:11,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

194
00:08:17,500 --> 00:08:18,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am here to fetch someone.</font>

195
00:08:20,180 --> 00:08:20,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan.</font>

196
00:08:21,820 --> 00:08:22,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come home with me.</font>

197
00:08:23,860 --> 00:08:24,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

198
00:08:26,340 --> 00:08:28,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're so forceful;</font>

199
00:08:28,540 --> 00:08:30,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no wonder you can't find a wife.</font>

200
00:08:30,460 --> 00:08:31,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That is my personal affair.</font>

201
00:08:32,540 --> 00:08:33,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't trouble yourself.</font>

202
00:08:36,220 --> 00:08:38,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun and I get along famously.</font>

203
00:08:39,060 --> 00:08:41,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I intend to make her my sworn sister.</font>

204
00:08:42,580 --> 00:08:44,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you say, Ms. Jun?</font>

205
00:08:48,020 --> 00:08:49,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am willing.</font>

206
00:08:49,620 --> 00:08:50,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You heard that, Your Highness?</font>

207
00:08:51,340 --> 00:08:52,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Affection, you see,</font>

208
00:08:52,660 --> 00:08:54,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must be mutual.</font>

209
00:08:58,020 --> 00:08:59,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am a solitary man,</font>

210
00:09:00,340 --> 00:09:02,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just seeking a pleasing companion
to warm my bed.</font>

211
00:09:04,180 --> 00:09:06,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,
are you trying to steal my prize?</font>

212
00:09:11,820 --> 00:09:12,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For Ms. Jun,</font>

213
00:09:13,420 --> 00:09:14,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it would not be impossible.</font>

214
00:09:18,100 --> 00:09:19,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have never been one
to restrain myself.</font>

215
00:09:20,780 --> 00:09:22,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If a real fight breaks out,</font>

216
00:09:22,780 --> 00:09:24,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I may not be able to hold back.</font>

217
00:09:34,060 --> 00:09:34,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

218
00:09:35,100 --> 00:09:35,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness!</font>

219
00:09:36,860 --> 00:09:37,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Guards!</font>

220
00:09:38,140 --> 00:09:38,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here!</font>

221
00:09:39,060 --> 00:09:40,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Escort my beloved consort home.</font>

222
00:09:40,700 --> 00:09:41,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

223
00:09:42,580 --> 00:09:43,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

224
00:09:44,260 --> 00:09:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you'll die a horrible death!</font>

225
00:09:58,660 --> 00:10:01,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

226
00:10:01,260 --> 00:10:02,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang, what brings you here?</font>

227
00:10:04,140 --> 00:10:06,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came for your wedding wine.</font>

228
00:10:08,860 --> 00:10:10,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There is no banquet here.</font>

229
00:10:12,300 --> 00:10:12,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here.</font>

230
00:10:13,140 --> 00:10:13,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take this money.</font>

231
00:10:14,420 --> 00:10:15,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Drink wherever you please.</font>

232
00:10:16,020 --> 00:10:16,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

233
00:10:17,020 --> 00:10:18,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you treating me like a beggar?</font>

234
00:10:18,700 --> 00:10:19,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you.</font>

235
00:10:19,500 --> 00:10:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan is my prized disciple.</font>

236
00:10:21,580 --> 00:10:22,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you just casually</font>

237
00:10:22,380 --> 00:10:23,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">bring her into your residence?</font>

238
00:10:25,100 --> 00:10:26,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, what do you propose?</font>

239
00:10:28,620 --> 00:10:29,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's talk inside.</font>

240
00:10:33,660 --> 00:10:36,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,
you don't know Qinglan's temper.</font>

241
00:10:37,420 --> 00:10:38,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's such a tomboy.</font>

242
00:10:38,900 --> 00:10:40,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's not worthy of you at all.</font>

243
00:10:40,620 --> 00:10:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So...</font>

244
00:10:41,180 --> 00:10:42,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I must return for my wedding night.</font>

245
00:10:43,500 --> 00:10:45,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have no time to listen
to your nostalgia.</font>

246
00:10:46,100 --> 00:10:46,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take my leave.</font>

247
00:10:47,340 --> 00:10:47,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

248
00:10:47,940 --> 00:10:48,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, no, wait.</font>

249
00:10:49,300 --> 00:10:50,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I spoke out of turn.</font>

250
00:10:50,900 --> 00:10:52,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, let me drink as punishment.</font>

251
00:10:55,220 --> 00:10:55,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

252
00:10:56,780 --> 00:10:57,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please, sit.</font>

253
00:11:00,140 --> 00:11:00,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

254
00:11:01,100 --> 00:11:01,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know,</font>

255
00:11:01,860 --> 00:11:04,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">people's temperaments
and quirks are innate.</font>

256
00:11:04,820 --> 00:11:06,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one can judge others' lives.</font>

257
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:06,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't that right?</font>

258
00:11:07,380 --> 00:11:08,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But life is too short</font>

259
00:11:08,900 --> 00:11:09,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to be so dull.</font>

260
00:11:10,540 --> 00:11:12,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Especially for someone like you,
with power and influence.</font>

261
00:11:12,820 --> 00:11:13,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should experience the sour,</font>

262
00:11:14,020 --> 00:11:15,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sweet, bitter,
and spicy flavors of life.</font>

263
00:11:15,700 --> 00:11:16,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Only then will your life</font>

264
00:11:17,380 --> 00:11:18,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">be truly perfect.</font>

265
00:11:18,820 --> 00:11:19,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me offer you another toast.</font>

266
00:11:20,460 --> 00:11:21,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I dislike beating around the bush.</font>

267
00:11:22,660 --> 00:11:24,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang, speak your mind.</font>

268
00:11:26,060 --> 00:11:27,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I must use my ultimate move.</font>

269
00:11:32,540 --> 00:11:33,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

270
00:11:33,860 --> 00:11:35,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is from my most treasured</font>

271
00:11:35,220 --> 00:11:36,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">hidden collection.</font>

272
00:11:37,780 --> 00:11:38,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Take a look.</font>

273
00:11:38,540 --> 00:11:40,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Each one is a top courtesan
from the pleasure house.</font>

274
00:11:41,100 --> 00:11:41,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

275
00:11:41,980 --> 00:11:42,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take your pick.</font>

276
00:11:43,580 --> 00:11:47,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

277
00:12:10,420 --> 00:12:10,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who goes there?</font>

278
00:12:11,020 --> 00:12:11,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop!</font>

279
00:12:21,700 --> 00:12:22,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My beloved consort.</font>

280
00:12:23,300 --> 00:12:24,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The residence is heavily guarded.</font>

281
00:12:25,620 --> 00:12:26,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wandering around so late at night,</font>

282
00:12:27,740 --> 00:12:29,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you could be mistaken for an assassin</font>

283
00:12:29,260 --> 00:12:30,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and shot dead on the spot.</font>

284
00:12:39,660 --> 00:12:40,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The night is too short.</font>

285
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:42,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry for keeping you waiting.</font>

286
00:12:43,780 --> 00:12:45,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which of your eyes
saw me waiting for you?</font>

287
00:12:47,780 --> 00:12:48,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go of me.</font>

288
00:12:49,020 --> 00:12:49,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go!</font>

289
00:12:50,540 --> 00:12:51,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go!</font>

290
00:12:59,380 --> 00:12:59,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you push me further,</font>

291
00:13:00,140 --> 00:13:01,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take you down with me.</font>

292
00:13:03,380 --> 00:13:04,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Quite a fiery spirit, aren't you?</font>

293
00:13:05,460 --> 00:13:06,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I like it.</font>

294
00:13:17,060 --> 00:13:19,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is from my most treasured
hidden collection.</font>

295
00:13:21,500 --> 00:13:23,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Each one is a top courtesan
from the pleasure house.</font>

296
00:13:24,740 --> 00:13:25,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

297
00:13:25,900 --> 00:13:26,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">take your pick.</font>

298
00:13:27,780 --> 00:13:28,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You had Jiang Yufan</font>

299
00:13:29,780 --> 00:13:31,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">poison my wine, didn't you?</font>

300
00:13:31,620 --> 00:13:33,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're incapable yourself.</font>

301
00:13:33,580 --> 00:13:34,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why slander me now?</font>

302
00:13:39,980 --> 00:13:41,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you coughing up blood?</font>

303
00:13:57,340 --> 00:13:57,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't go.</font>

304
00:14:00,980 --> 00:14:02,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't leave me.</font>

305
00:14:02,900 --> 00:14:04,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't leave me here alone.</font>

306
00:14:17,900 --> 00:14:19,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're so weak.</font>

307
00:14:20,100 --> 00:14:21,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet your strength hasn't lessened.</font>

308
00:14:57,620 --> 00:14:58,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,
could you let me go first?</font>

309
00:15:12,100 --> 00:15:13,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know acupuncture?</font>

310
00:15:13,420 --> 00:15:14,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The poison is attacking your heart.</font>

311
00:15:14,980 --> 00:15:15,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was just a desperate attempt.</font>

312
00:15:16,420 --> 00:15:17,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've only ever done it on corpses.</font>

313
00:15:19,860 --> 00:15:20,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In that case,</font>

314
00:15:21,420 --> 00:15:22,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you saved my life.</font>

315
00:15:23,100 --> 00:15:24,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need not thank me.</font>

316
00:15:24,660 --> 00:15:25,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just let me go.</font>

317
00:15:29,620 --> 00:15:31,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It seems I was too rough last night.</font>

318
00:15:33,220 --> 00:15:35,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ms. Jun served me well last night.</font>

319
00:15:35,820 --> 00:15:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help her freshen up properly.</font>

320
00:15:37,300 --> 00:15:38,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

321
00:15:46,300 --> 00:15:46,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

322
00:15:46,940 --> 00:15:47,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The scissors you requested.</font>

323
00:15:56,420 --> 00:15:57,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Such a lavish spread.</font>

324
00:15:58,660 --> 00:15:59,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where's the silver needle?</font>

325
00:15:59,540 --> 00:16:00,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why do you need a silver needle?</font>

326
00:16:00,980 --> 00:16:01,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For a poison test.</font>

327
00:16:02,620 --> 00:16:04,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan harbors ill intentions.</font>

328
00:16:04,740 --> 00:16:05,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I am not careful,</font>

329
00:16:05,940 --> 00:16:07,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">even nine lives wouldn't be enough
for his games.</font>

330
00:16:08,300 --> 00:16:08,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

331
00:16:13,740 --> 00:16:14,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

332
00:16:14,820 --> 00:16:16,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing with those scissors?</font>

333
00:16:16,780 --> 00:16:18,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you planning to silence me
by killing me?</font>

334
00:16:18,660 --> 00:16:20,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was the one who saved you last night.</font>

335
00:16:26,380 --> 00:16:27,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]
Why are you running?</font>

336
00:16:27,300 --> 00:16:28,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You coward.</font>

337
00:16:28,460 --> 00:16:29,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If anything happens to Jun,</font>

338
00:16:29,740 --> 00:16:30,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will have Father banish you to Suzhou</font>

339
00:16:30,980 --> 00:16:32,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to be a boatman and steer a boat.</font>

340
00:16:33,940 --> 00:16:34,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Open the door! Open up!</font>

341
00:16:35,820 --> 00:16:36,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go away.</font>

342
00:16:37,020 --> 00:16:37,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We are here to congratulate</font>

343
00:16:37,740 --> 00:16:38,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">- the Prince on his wedding.
- You two!</font>

344
00:16:38,860 --> 00:16:39,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two!</font>

345
00:16:47,580 --> 00:16:49,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where should I even begin?</font>

346
00:16:52,580 --> 00:16:53,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be nervous.</font>

347
00:16:54,780 --> 00:16:55,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're a coroner.</font>

348
00:16:56,220 --> 00:16:57,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've seen it all.</font>

349
00:16:59,380 --> 00:17:00,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing to be shy about.</font>

350
00:17:01,060 --> 00:17:02,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just bear it for a moment.</font>

351
00:17:07,820 --> 00:17:08,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You want to speak, don't you?</font>

352
00:17:11,460 --> 00:17:11,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

353
00:17:12,540 --> 00:17:14,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can you be so cruel to a girl?</font>

354
00:17:14,900 --> 00:17:15,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why shouldn't I be?</font>

355
00:17:17,140 --> 00:17:17,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you dare!</font>

356
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:25,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

357
00:17:26,430 --> 00:17:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

358
00:17:28,100 --> 00:17:31,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

359
00:17:32,020 --> 00:17:36,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

360
00:17:36,700 --> 00:17:40,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

361
00:17:40,680 --> 00:17:44,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

362
00:17:45,210 --> 00:17:49,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

363
00:17:49,540 --> 00:17:55,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

364
00:17:57,670 --> 00:18:01,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

365
00:18:02,350 --> 00:18:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

366
00:18:06,390 --> 00:18:10,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

367
00:18:10,940 --> 00:18:13,930
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

368
00:18:14,920 --> 00:18:19,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

369
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:23,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
